          "value": "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-2\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-10 \\\\  & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
